---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { Image, getImage } from 'astro:assets';
import image0 from '../assets/nuestra-mision-0.jpg';
import image1 from '../assets/nuestra-mision-1.jpg';
import mobileImage0 from '../assets/nuestra-mision-mobile-0.jpg';
const mobile0 = await getImage({src: mobileImage0, width: 700, format: 'webp', quality: 80});
import mobileImage1 from '../assets/nuestra-mision-mobile-1.jpg';
const mobile1 = await getImage({src: mobileImage1, width: 700, format: 'webp', quality: 80});
---
<Layout title="Nuestra misión y labor con gatos" description="Conoce nuestras siete áreas de trabajo: rescate, rehabilitación veterinaria, adopción responsable, hogares de paso y educación para el bienestar animal." label="Nuestra Misión">
<main class="w-full bg-background min-h-screen page-content nuestra-mision" id="contenido"><div class="flex flex-col w-full">

<section class="relative w-full overflow-hidden bg-surface-container-lowest pb-space-xl">
<div class="absolute -top-32 right-12 w-96 h-96 rounded-full bg-secondary-container/20 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
<div class="absolute top-48 left-0 w-80 h-80 rounded-full bg-tertiary-fixed/30 blur-2xl pointer-events-none"></div>
<div class="max-w-[1320px] mx-auto px-margin pt-space-lg relative z-10">

<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-space-sm mb-space-md">
<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-space-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-container text-primary font-label-statutory text-label-statutory tracking-widest uppercase">
<span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-secondary animate-pulse"></span>
<span>Actividad Meritoria Estatutaria · ESAL Medellín</span>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-space-xs font-label-statutory text-label-statutory text-on-surface-variant">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[15px] text-secondary" aria-hidden="true">verified</span>
<span>Personería Jurídica Vigente · NIT 902098987-7</span>
</div>
</div>

<div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-gutter items-end">
<div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-8 flex flex-col gap-space-sm">
<h1 class="font-display-lg text-display-lg text-primary tracking-tight">
            Nuestra Misión y <br /><span class="italic font-headline-lg font-medium text-secondary">Labor con Gatos</span>
</h1>
<p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
            Salvaguarda rigurosa de fauna doméstica felina en condiciones de abandono crítico, enfermedad o vulnerabilidad extrema en el Valle de Aburrá, canalizada a través del amparo legal del Régimen Tributario Especial (ESAL).
          </p>
</div>

<div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-4 bg-primary text-on-primary p-space-lg rounded-xl shadow-md flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden -mt-4 lg:mt-0">
<div class="absolute -right-8 -bottom-8 opacity-10 pointer-events-none">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[140px] text-on-primary" aria-hidden="true">pets</span>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-space-xs mb-space-sm text-secondary-container font-label-statutory text-label-statutory uppercase">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]" aria-hidden="true">format_quote</span>
<span>Compromiso Estatutario</span>
</div>
<blockquote class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm italic leading-snug mb-space-md text-surface-bright">
            “Transformar el sufrimiento invisible en historias documentadas de dignidad, amparo veterinario y segundas oportunidades fundamentadas en la ética institucional.”
          </blockquote>
<div class="pt-space-sm border-t border-primary-container flex items-center justify-between text-on-primary-container font-label-statutory text-label-statutory">
<span>NIT: 902098987-7</span>
<span>Medellín, Antioquia</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="mt-space-xl p-space-lg bg-surface-container-low rounded-xl shadow-sm">
<div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-gutter items-center">
<div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col gap-space-xs">
<div class="flex items-center gap-space-xs text-secondary font-label-statutory text-label-statutory uppercase tracking-wider">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]" aria-hidden="true">account_balance</span>
<span>Protocolo de Transparencia Pública</span>
</div>
<h2 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary">Marco de Diferenciación Operativa</h2>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
              Como Entidad Sin Ánimo de Lucro comprometida con la rendición de cuentas ante la ciudadanía y la DIAN, separamos con estricta veracidad técnica lo que ejecutamos actualmente en territorio frente a las líneas estatutarias autorizadas en fases de fondeo o despliegue futuro.
            </p>
</div>
<div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-7 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-space-md">

<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-md rounded-lg shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
<div class="flex items-center gap-space-xs mb-space-xs">
<span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-secondary-container border border-secondary flex items-center justify-center">
<span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-secondary"></span>
</span>
<span class="font-label-lg text-label-lg text-primary font-bold tracking-wide">PROGRAMA ACTIVO</span>
</div>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">
                Operación vigente, financiamiento asegurado y casos clínicos en curso directo bajo supervisión médica veterinaria continua.
              </p>
<div class="mt-space-sm inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-label-statutory text-label-statutory text-secondary uppercase">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]" aria-hidden="true">task_alt</span>
<span>Auditado y en ejecución</span>
</div>
</div>

<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-md rounded-lg shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
<div class="flex items-center gap-space-xs mb-space-xs">
<span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-tertiary-fixed border border-tertiary-container flex items-center justify-center">
<span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-on-tertiary-container"></span>
</span>
<span class="font-label-lg text-label-lg text-tertiary-container font-bold tracking-wide">ESTATUTARIAMENTE PREVISTO</span>
</div>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">
                Habilitado formalmente en el objeto social de la Fundación. En proceso de estructuración operativa, rondas de donación o convocatorias públicas.
              </p>
<div class="mt-space-sm inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-label-statutory text-label-statutory text-on-tertiary-container uppercase">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]" aria-hidden="true">schedule</span>
<span>Fase de consolidación</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="w-full py-space-xl bg-background">
<div class="max-w-[1320px] mx-auto px-margin">

<div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-space-sm mb-space-xl">
<div>
<span class="font-label-statutory text-label-statutory text-secondary uppercase tracking-widest block mb-1">Estatuto Operativo · 7 Pilares</span>
<h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-primary">Ejes Clave de Acción Misional</h2>
</div>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant max-w-md">
          Cada eje responde a un protocolo técnico estandarizado que garantiza la debida custodia clínica, legal y afectiva de los felinos intervenidos.
        </p>
</div><div class="program-filters" aria-label="Filtrar áreas de trabajo"><button type="button" data-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">Todos (7)</button><button type="button" data-filter="active" aria-pressed="false">Activos hoy (5)</button><button type="button" data-filter="planned" aria-pressed="false">Estatutarios (2)</button></div><p class="sr-only" role="status" id="filter-status"></p>

<div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-gutter">

<div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-8 bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-md overflow-hidden flex flex-col md:flex-row min-w-0 transition-transform duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1" data-program="active">
<div class="md:w-5/12 relative min-h-[260px] md:min-h-full">
<picture class="responsive-picture"><source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset={mobile0.src} width={mobile0.attributes.width} height={mobile0.attributes.height} /><Image src={image0} alt="Cuidado y recuperación de gatos rescatados" class="w-full h-full object-cover" widths={[400, 800, 1200]} sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 50vw" format="webp" quality={80} loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></picture>
<div class="absolute top-3 left-3 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-surface-container/90 backdrop-blur-md text-primary font-label-statutory text-label-statutory flex items-center gap-1 shadow-sm">
<span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-secondary"></span>
<span>PROGRAMA ACTIVO</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="md:w-7/12 p-space-lg flex flex-col justify-between">
<div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-space-xs">
<span class="font-label-statutory text-label-statutory text-secondary font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">EJE 01 · GESTIÓN DE CRISIS</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[20px]" aria-hidden="true">medical_services</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary mb-space-xs">Rescate de Gatos Vulnerables</h3>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-space-md">
                Intervención enfocada con prioridad absoluta en casos de alta vulnerabilidad médica: felinos atropellados, víctimas de maltrato físico constatado, neonatos huérfanos o cuadros sépticos críticos en el área metropolitana.
              </p>
<div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-space-sm bg-surface-container-low p-space-sm rounded-lg font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface">
<div class="flex items-center gap-space-xs">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-primary" aria-hidden="true">emergency</span>
<span>Triaje ético de ingreso</span>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-space-xs">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-primary" aria-hidden="true">bed</span>
<span>Aislamiento y reposo</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mt-space-md pt-space-xs flex items-center justify-between text-on-surface-variant font-label-md text-label-md">
<span class="text-secondary font-semibold">Tasa de estabilización primaria: 92%</span>
<span class="text-on-surface-variant font-label-statutory text-label-statutory">Medellín &amp; Valle de Aburrá</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-4 bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-lg rounded-xl shadow-md flex flex-col justify-between min-w-0 transition-transform duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1" data-program="active">
<div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-space-xs">
<span class="font-label-statutory text-label-statutory text-secondary font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">EJE 02 · SALUD CLÍNICA</span>
<span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-secondary-container text-on-secondary-fixed font-label-statutory text-label-statutory">ACTIVO</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary mb-space-xs">Atención y Rehabilitación Veterinaria</h3>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-space-md">
              Abordaje biomédico exhaustivo: tamizaje serológico triple (FIV / FeLV), cuadros hemáticos, cirugías reconstructivas, profilaxis dental y desparasitación protocolizada en alianza con clínicas veterinarias certificadas 24/7.
            </p>

<div class="space-y-2">
<div class="flex justify-between items-center text-body-sm font-label-md">
<span class="text-on-surface-variant">Pruebas Virales FIV/FeLV Aplicadas</span>
<span class="text-primary font-bold">100% ingresos</span>
</div>
<div class="w-full bg-surface-container h-2 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
<div class="bg-secondary h-full rounded-full" style="width: 100%"></div>
</div>
<div class="flex justify-between items-center text-body-sm font-label-md pt-1">
<span class="text-on-surface-variant">Esquema Vacunal Triple Felina Completo</span>
<span class="text-primary font-bold">100% pre-adopción</span>
</div>
<div class="w-full bg-surface-container h-2 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
<div class="bg-secondary h-full rounded-full" style="width: 100%"></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mt-space-md inline-flex items-center gap-space-xs text-primary font-label-statutory text-label-statutory">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-secondary" aria-hidden="true">local_hospital</span>
<span>Historial Clínico Digital Unificado por Paciente</span>
</div>
</div>

<div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-4 bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-lg rounded-xl shadow-md flex flex-col justify-between min-w-0 transition-transform duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1" data-program="active">
<div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-space-xs">
<span class="font-label-statutory text-label-statutory text-secondary font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">EJE 03 · RESTITUCIÓN DE HOGAR</span>
<span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-secondary-container text-on-secondary-fixed font-label-statutory text-label-statutory">ACTIVO</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary mb-space-xs" id="adopciones">Adopciones Responsables</h3>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-space-md">
              Proceso selectivo que trasciende la simple entrega animal. Aplicamos entrevistas estructuradas, evaluación de dinámicas familiares, análisis de solvencia para manutención y firma de contrato con reserva de restitución.
            </p>
<div class="p-space-sm bg-surface-container-low rounded-lg space-y-2">
<div class="flex items-start gap-space-xs text-body-sm text-on-surface">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-secondary flex-shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">grid_view</span>
<span><strong>Mallas de seguridad:</strong> Verificación fotográfica y presencial en ventanas y balcones (indispensable).</span>
</div>
<div class="flex items-start gap-space-xs text-body-sm text-on-surface">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-secondary flex-shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">gavel</span>
<span>Contrato legal con seguimiento post-adopción a 30, 90 y 180 días.</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mt-space-md pt-space-xs flex items-center justify-between text-on-surface-variant font-label-statutory text-label-statutory">
<span>Cero entregas sin esterilización</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[18px]" aria-hidden="true">verified_user</span>
</div>
</div>

<div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-4 bg-surface-container-low p-space-lg rounded-xl shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between min-w-0 transition-transform duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 relative" data-program="planned">
<div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-space-xs">
<span class="font-label-statutory text-label-statutory text-on-tertiary-container font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">EJE 04 · CONTROL ÉTICO</span>
<span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-tertiary-fixed text-on-tertiary-fixed-variant font-label-statutory text-label-statutory flex items-center gap-1">
<span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-on-tertiary-container"></span>
<span>ESTATUTARIAMENTE PREVISTO</span>
</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary mb-space-xs">Esterilización Masiva y Prevención</h3>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-space-md">
              Línea proyectada en estatutos para ejecutar jornadas quirúrgicas móviles a bajo o nulo costo en comunas periféricas y corregimientos de Medellín (San Cristóbal, Santa Elena, San Antonio de Prado).
            </p>

<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-md rounded-lg shadow-sm">
<div class="flex justify-between items-center text-body-sm mb-1">
<span class="font-title-md text-title-md text-primary">Fondo Semilla de Esterilizaciones</span>
<span class="font-label-statutory text-label-statutory text-on-tertiary-container font-bold">Fase de Apertura</span>
</div>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mb-2">
                Meta estatutaria: 500 procedimientos anuales subvencionados para familias de estratos 1 y 2.
              </p>
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-on-surface-variant font-label-statutory text-label-statutory">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-tertiary" aria-hidden="true">hourglass_top</span>
<span>En convocatoria de donaciones corporativas DIAN</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mt-space-md pt-space-xs flex items-center justify-between text-on-surface-variant font-label-statutory text-label-statutory">
<span>Régimen Especial ESAL</span>
<span class="text-tertiary font-bold">Fondo Específico N° 04</span>
</div>
</div>

<div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-4 bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-md overflow-hidden flex flex-col min-w-0 transition-transform duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1" data-program="active">
<div class="relative h-44 w-full">
<picture class="responsive-picture"><source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset={mobile1.src} width={mobile1.attributes.width} height={mobile1.attributes.height} /><Image src={image1} alt="Cuidado y recuperación de gatos rescatados" class="w-full h-full object-cover" widths={[400, 800, 1200]} sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 50vw" format="webp" quality={80} loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></picture>
<div class="absolute top-3 left-3 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-surface-container/90 backdrop-blur-md text-primary font-label-statutory text-label-statutory flex items-center gap-1 shadow-sm">
<span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-secondary"></span>
<span>PROGRAMA ACTIVO</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="p-space-lg flex flex-col justify-between flex-grow">
<div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-space-xs">
<span class="font-label-statutory text-label-statutory text-secondary font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">EJE 05 · COMUNIDAD</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[20px]" aria-hidden="true">volunteer_activism</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary mb-space-xs">Red de Hogares de Paso y Voluntariado</h3>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
                Rechazamos el hacinamiento en refugios masivos que propagan enfermedades virales. Operamos bajo el modelo ético de acogida temporal domiciliaria, donde el gato recibe afecto y socialización individualizada.
              </p>
</div>
<div class="mt-space-md pt-space-xs flex items-center justify-between text-on-surface-variant font-label-statutory text-label-statutory">
<span class="text-secondary font-bold">28 Hogares de paso certificados</span>
<span>Medellín</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-6 bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-lg rounded-xl shadow-md flex flex-col justify-between min-w-0 transition-transform duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1" data-program="active">
<div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-space-xs">
<span class="font-label-statutory text-label-statutory text-secondary font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">EJE 06 · TRANSFORMACIÓN CULTURAL</span>
<span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-secondary-container text-on-secondary-fixed font-label-statutory text-label-statutory">ACTIVO</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary mb-space-xs">Educación sobre Bienestar Animal</h3>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-space-md">
              Desmontamos mitos arraigados que perpetúan el abandono felino a través de pedagogía comunitaria y contenido validado científicamente.
            </p>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-space-sm">
<div class="p-space-sm bg-surface-container rounded-lg">
<div class="font-title-md text-title-md text-primary mb-1 flex items-center gap-1">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-secondary" aria-hidden="true">psychology</span>
<span>Mito: Toxoplasmosis</span>
</div>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">
                  Instrucción médica a gestantes y médicos generales sobre vías reales de transmisión (carne cruda vs. heces no aseadas oportunamente).
                </p>
</div>
<div class="p-space-sm bg-surface-container rounded-lg">
<div class="font-title-md text-title-md text-primary mb-1 flex items-center gap-1">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-secondary" aria-hidden="true">home</span>
<span>Cultura 100% Indoor</span>
</div>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">
                  Campaña permanente de tenencia confinada segura: prevención de atropellamientos, peleas territoriales y envenenamientos de vecindario.
                </p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mt-space-md pt-space-xs flex items-center justify-between text-on-surface-variant font-label-statutory text-label-statutory">
<span>Talleres en copropiedades y colegios</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[18px]" aria-hidden="true">school</span>
</div>
</div>

<div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-6 bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-lg rounded-xl shadow-md flex flex-col justify-between min-w-0 transition-transform duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1" data-program="planned">
<div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-space-xs">
<span class="font-label-statutory text-label-statutory text-secondary font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">EJE 07 · INCIDENCIA JURÍDICA</span>
<span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-secondary-container text-on-secondary-fixed font-label-statutory text-label-statutory">ACTIVO</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary mb-space-xs">Protección Integral de Fauna Doméstica</h3>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-space-md">
              Vigilancia legal y aplicación del marco de la <strong>Ley 1774 de 2016</strong> en Colombia, reconociendo a los gatos como <em>seres sintientes</em> con derecho a no padecer hambre, sed, dolor o angustia injustificada.
            </p>
<div class="p-space-sm bg-surface-container-low rounded-lg space-y-2">
<div class="flex items-center gap-space-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-primary" aria-hidden="true">balance</span>
<span>Articulación con Inspecciones de Policía de Medellín para decomisos preventivos.</span>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-space-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-primary" aria-hidden="true">policy</span>
<span>Radicación de denuncias penales ante grupo GELMA de la Fiscalía General de la Nación.</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mt-space-md pt-space-xs flex items-center justify-between text-on-surface-variant font-label-statutory text-label-statutory">
<span>Blindaje Jurídico de Actas de Entrega</span>
<span class="text-primary font-bold">Ley 1774/2016</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

